      "cooked": "<p>Ambuscade has returned with a Vengeance! Bringing along Plague Rat, Biomancer, Baron Blade and Greazer in a Challenge match to take on last week’s team of Luminary, Super Scientific Tachyon, Omnitron-X, Rogue Agent K.N.Y.F.E., and Freedom Five Bunker, this time in Magmaria.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/a/a4e0c3c9326f800fec7a6bbae053ecccf04b0e09.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/a4e0c3c9326f800fec7a6bbae053ecccf04b0e09\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a4e0c3c9326f800fec7a6bbae053ecccf04b0e09_2_231x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"nwzRpzPfmgQwtqTeciwLZeziULD\" width=\"231\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a4e0c3c9326f800fec7a6bbae053ecccf04b0e09_2_231x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a4e0c3c9326f800fec7a6bbae053ecccf04b0e09_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a4e0c3c9326f800fec7a6bbae053ecccf04b0e09_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a4e0c3c9326f800fec7a6bbae053ecccf04b0e09_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">828×1792 155 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>And it may have taken me three or four tries, but I finally got to this:<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/f/f5642824783e52da579b2f1352e9192d6dd97e9e.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/f5642824783e52da579b2f1352e9192d6dd97e9e\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f5642824783e52da579b2f1352e9192d6dd97e9e_2_231x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"z0Pz2JIADV5iCHUanmeha4n0uKi\" width=\"231\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f5642824783e52da579b2f1352e9192d6dd97e9e_2_231x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f5642824783e52da579b2f1352e9192d6dd97e9e_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f5642824783e52da579b2f1352e9192d6dd97e9e_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f5642824783e52da579b2f1352e9192d6dd97e9e_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">828×1792 151 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Which is the best loss I’ve had yet. I’m spinning my wheels on this one. It may require some group think. Anyone have clues out there? What I’ve tried so far or noticed:</p>\n<details>\n<summary>\nSummary</summary>\n<p>Tried to build up Luminary, but just as I power up the Orbital Death-Laser, Ambuscade pulls out 2 Enticing Targets and it’s game over.<br>\nTried to build up Omnitron-X. If he can get Ablative Coating out, he stands up well to Plague Rat and most of Biomancer’s Fleshchildren. Couldn’t get it to work out, though.<br>\nTried focusing on Baron Blade. If he isn’t the highest health target, Plague Rat will attack other villains instead. But as it stands, he attacks Baron Blade who is immune to villain damage.<br>\nTried focusing on Tachyon and that gave my best results. There were a few misplays so maybe it’s still the way to go.</p>\n<p>Other notes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Killing Biomancer’s Fleshchildren is useless. He just heals up and gets more cards. Except for a few exceptional ones, don’t bother. I can’t figure out a way to overwhelm his damage reduction and take him out.</li>\n<li>Baron Blade is mostly harmless in this one except that he soaks up Plague Rat’s damage.</li>\n<li>Plague Rat is good for killing off Nemesis cards that you can’t normally hit easily because of Glamour</li>\n<li>Omnitron-X’s Defensive Blast is an excellent way to harm the Nemesis villains and Biomancer. If you do it when Omnitron-X is the highest health hero, then Glamour’s redirect will go back to him and he will harmlessly soak up the damage.</li>\n</ul>\n</details>",
